      "sourceTextSha256": "467fe93beb126e4c48d00f0eaba02a967d1fe36fb48a3dca47d21a00b2b1bcd8",
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Group tour to the Perito Moreno glacier in SIB with an English speaking guide.\n\nPerito Moreno Glacier - a magnificent giant ice glacier   the length of the river   100 km, a height greater than 60 m and a width of about 4 km, which is slowly slipping from the Andean peaks in the water of the Argentine Lake. Hundreds of thousands of tourists from all over the world come here to admire the spectacular sight as well as the powerful crumbling ice walls of the glacier which slowly fall under water, raising up huge waves.",
